# Every text file checks out as LF on every platform. Without this, a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites Go sources to CRLF, and `gofmt -l .`
# then reports every one of them as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-sensitive paths: goldens and the pinned vault templates are compared
# byte-for-byte, so git must never convert their line endings. -text disables
# every conversion.
internal/**/testdata/** -text
*.jsonl -text
